SUMMARY:Colorado: DR 0106 due
DESCRIPTION:Colorado partnership/S-corp return due the 15th day of the 4th 
 month after year-end. The state's own current page's example date is from 2
 024 ("Calendar year returns are due by April 15\, 2024")\, confirming the 4
 th-month rule\; the specific 2026 date is computed from that rule\, not ind
 ependently quoted for 2026. | Colorado partnership/S-corp return due the 15
 th day of the 4th month after year-end. The state's own current page's exam
 ple date is from 2024 ("Calendar year returns are due by April 15\, 2024")\
 , confirming the 4th-month rule\; the specific 2026 date is computed from t
 hat rule\, not independently quoted for 2026. Automatic extension\; at leas
 t 90% of tax liability must be paid by the original due date. | Authority: 
